    <briefdescription>
<para>Buddy Allocator - Variable size allocation with binary subdivision. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Features:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Allocation: O(log n)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Deallocation: O(log n) with coalescing</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Low to medium fragmentation</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Best for: Mixed size allocations </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
